Well, I'm working on one as well, so here's what I'm thinking.

First, you'll need markers, lots of markers (I have 5 so far with about 250
charges total, and I haven't polypiled my unihorn collection yet.)  You can
Write a spellbook of a spell you need to re-learn that has faded.  (they do
become blank paper IIRC)  Also, you can count on finding several books you
could do without along the way, so you can always get a spell back as long
as your markers hold out.

Next, you're going to find a lot of stuff.  Set up a home base.  Drag chests
there to keep stuff in.  Use controlled levelport to come and go.  I'm set
up on level 1 in the up-stairs room.  You might choose minesend or the
bottom of the quest since the EoA will make getting to those levels easy.

